    "npc.tacet_grunt_a": "TACET Grunt",
    "npc.tacet_grunt_b": "TACET Grunt",
    "quietcoast.fisher.1": "Song don't reach here. Hasn't since the Caesura.",
    "quietcoast.fisher.2": "You get used to- no. You don't.",
    "rival2.cade.defeat": "Cade: …appendix B: 'galliards are a phase'. Page sixty-one.",
    "rival2.cade.intro": "Cade: Notebook update! You're ranked 'annoyingly ahead'. Time to fix the data!",
    "rt2.courier.after": "Package was late anyway. Don't tell dispatch.",
    "rt2.courier.defeat": "Signed, sealed, defeated.",
    "rt2.courier.intro": "Priority delivery! You're the obstacle on my route sheet.",
    "rt2.gardener.after": "Hm. The hedges liked your phrasing better.",
    "rt2.gardener.defeat": "Pruned, fair and square.",
    "rt2.gardener.intro": "These hedges grow to MY tempo. You're rushing them.",
    "rt3.chorister.after": "The descant section approves.",
    "rt3.chorister.defeat": "We'll transpose and try again.",
    "rt3.chorister.intro": "Five parts, one throat. Care to be the sixth?",
    "rt3.drover.after": "Herd's taken a liking. That's worse than the fight.",
    "rt3.drover.defeat": "Off-key, me. Entirely.",
    "rt3.drover.intro": "My herd calls in fifths. You'll harmonize or you'll move.",
    "rt4.signaler.after": "Green light. Through you go.",
    "rt4.signaler.defeat": "Signal lost…",
    "rt4.signaler.intro": "I keep the rail lamps in sequence. You're out of sequence.",
    "rt4.stoker.after": "Banked my coals for the night. You too, eh?",
    "rt4.stoker.defeat": "Doused!",
    "rt4.stoker.intro": "Furnace runs on rhythm. So do I. Stoke or be stoked!",
    "tacet.shipment.1": "Hold it. This crate of bells is, uh, being liberated.",
    "tacet.shipment.2": "Motes were free before bells, kid. Walk away.",
    "tacet.shipment.flee": "The crate stays?! Fine - the IDEA was liberated.",
    "tacet.yard.1": "The tuning yard's closed. Permanently. By order of nobody you know.",
    "tacet.yard.2": "Two of us, one of you - even our math works on that.",
    "tacet.yard.flee": "Noted: math insufficient. Withdrawing!",
    "theft.cade.1": "Cade: Who steals the LEFTOVER?! That's not even good crime!",
    "theft.reed.1": "Reed: They came in the night. Professional. Quiet as a rest.",
    "theft.reed.2": "Reed: They took the third - the one neither of you chose.",
    "theft.reed.3": "Reed: …Someone who thinks 'leftover' is the cruelest word in this building. Watch the roads, both of you.",
    "dex.bogritone": "A drowned log that kept the song it sank with. It surfaces every few years to check whether anyone still remembers the words. Nobody does.",
    "dex.croakorus": "One Croakorus is a metronome; a bog of them is a male voice choir with no conductor and no shame. Hollowfen sells earplugs at the ferry dock.",
    "dex.dynamaestro": "Four turbines of muscle conduct the city's whole load through its spine. During outages it stands very still and looks extremely guilty.",
    "dex.dynamotif": "It stores the morning shift-change surge and spends it all day as a steady working hum. Voltaccia's grid is, legally speaking, livestock.",
    "dex.fenadenza": "Its blossom opens only for the swamp's final cadence each dusk, drinking the held chord. Perfumers have died rich trying to bottle it.",
    "dex.mirefall": "It sleeps under the fen and surfaces as a slow brown chord when rain rewrites the water table. Hollowfen builds its stilts around known Mirefall beds.",
    "dex.pistonna": "Its forearms fire in strict alternation, a two-stroke percussion the factories tune themselves against. It refuses to work overtime.",
    "dex.ratchetta": "It tightens loose bolts compulsively, one click per beat. Maintenance crews follow one around instead of doing inspections.",
    "dex.smogturne": "It feeds on stack exhaust and exhales it as a low nocturne that corrodes gutters. Voltaccia fines it; it has never paid.",
    "dex.willowisp": "It lights the fen's drowned staff lines, one bar at a time, leading travelers either home or under. It genuinely cannot tell which it did.",
    "motif.bogritone": "Bogritone",
    "motif.croakorus": "Croakorus",
    "motif.dynamaestro": "Dynamaestro",
    "motif.dynamotif": "Dynamotif",
    "motif.fenadenza": "Fenadenza",
    "motif.mirefall": "Mirefall",
    "motif.pistonna": "Pistonna",
    "motif.ratchetta": "Ratchetta",
    "motif.smogturne": "Smogturne",
    "motif.willowisp": "Willowisp",
    "dex.avalanche": "When it shrugs, the mountain plays one enormous chord and then a very long rest. Graven Pass closes on its birthday, which nobody has dared confirm.",
    "dex.cadenzear": "Born in concert-hall rafters, it improvises codas onto street musicians' endings. Cadenza City's buskers split tips with it by custom.",
    "dex.gravelody": "It rolls scree downslope in measured phrases, resetting the pass's percussion every spring. Roadmenders call the rockfalls 'rehearsals'.",
    "dex.gravoross": "Its shoulders carry the pass's oldest cairn, builders unknown. It reroutes around pilgrim trails without being asked.",
    "dex.nullavoce": "Where it stands, sound files a complaint and leaves. The Conservatory's severance lattice was reverse-engineered, quietly, from its hide.",
    "dex.orchestrios": "Eighty brass pipes grew through its body when it slept a century in the old organ loft. It is the loft, mostly, now.",
    "dex.permafrond": "A fern that chose winter and never looked back. Its fronds chime against each other in a key botanists insist plants cannot reach.",
    "dex.primavoce": "The first voice, older than the bells, singing the root the world tunes against. The Roster's first column begins with the trainers who heard it and stayed sane.",
    "dex.shiverine": "It skates the windward faces on bladed wingtips, scoring the ice with tomorrow's forecast. Frostine's lift operators read the runes and strike accordingly.",
    "dex.vespernox": "Vesper's own line: bred in the rests between watch-bells, striking on the off-beat nobody guards. TACET's admins carry its grace notes like sidearms.",
    "motif.avalanche": "Avalanchord",
    "motif.cadenzear": "Cadenzear",
    "motif.gravelody": "Gravelody",
    "motif.gravoross": "Gravoross",
    "motif.nullavoce": "Nullavoce",
    "motif.orchestrios": "Orchestrios",
    "motif.permafrond": "Permafrond",
    "motif.primavoce": "Primavoce",
    "motif.shiverine": "Shiverine",
    "motif.vespernox": "Vespernox",
    "dex.cantavella": "The Triad's rising third: the phrase that asks. Pilgrims climb Graven Pass to hear one question and spend their lives on the answer.",
    "dex.choralopod": "Eight arms, eight parts, one extremely confident soloist's ego. Reef fish school in whatever key it's rehearsing.",
    "dex.emberlith": "A kiln the mountain forgot to put out. Caravans winter beside it, paying in firewood and gossip; it prefers the gossip.",
    "dex.ferrobass": "A harbor chain that learned the work songs and grew a body to haul with. It moors itself at night to whichever ship sang best.",
    "dex.galegant": "It charges fences for the sound they make breaking, then apologizes by rebuilding worse. Ranchers bill the wind.",
    "dex.intervallia": "The Triad's falling fifth: the distance between voices, given fins. Tides obey the moon; the moon, fishermen say, checks with her first.",
    "dex.maestrina": "It conducts clearings: birdsong enters on its downbeat or not at all. Arbor Vale's choir director resigned after meeting one. 'Outclassed,' the letter said.",
    "dex.taciturn": "The Triad's held rest: the silence that gives the song its shape. The Caesura, some keepers whisper, was it turning over in its sleep.",
    "dex.velvetide": "It swims the midnight layer where pressure mutes every voice but its own. Deep crews report a lullaby through the hull and unusually good sleep.",
    "dex.zephyrune": "It writes on high wind in long calligraphic gusts; the letters land days later as weather. Frostine's almanac is just transcription.",
    "motif.cantavella": "Cantavella",
    "motif.choralopod": "Choralopod",
    "motif.emberlith": "Emberlith",
    "motif.ferrobass": "Ferrobass",
    "motif.galegant": "Galegant",
    "motif.intervallia": "Intervallia",
    "motif.maestrina": "Maestrina",
    "motif.taciturn": "Taciturn",
    "motif.velvetide": "Velvetide",
    "motif.zephyrune": "Zephyrune",
    "anchor.1": "Hush: Ah. The schedule said you'd be taller. TACET business - the anchor's ours tonight.",
    "anchor.2": "Hush: Well fought. Sincerely. And - thank you for the cover; the noise upstairs was exactly enough.",
    "anchor.3": "Hush: A parting gift. Read it somewhere with music, if you can still find any.",
    "aria.1": "At the bottom of everything: a held chord, and inside it, barely a person, still holding - ARIA.",
    "aria.2": "Twelve years of one note. Her eyes find yours. They are very tired and not at all surprised.",
    "aria.vesper": "Vesper: Now. Ask the only question that was ever real: who holds the world, and for how long?",
    "chorus.1": "You raise your Score - sixty percent of a world's worth of voices, transcribed by hand - and the keepers' eight echoes answer it.",
    "chorus.2": "The Held Note distributes. Your whole box appears, every Mote you ever attuned, taking a microscopic share. Then every trainer's. Then everyone's.",
    "chorus.3": "Aria wakes. Vesper surrenders the lattice - 'a chorus. I only ever heard solos.' Calder resigns, and reads the Roster aloud. Name by name.",
    "chorus.credits": "The song was never written for one voice.",
    "confess.1": "Reed: You've read it, then. The Roster. I can see it on you - that ledger leaves fingerprints.",
    "confess.2": "Reed: Yes, I knew the shape of it. For years. And I kept training candidates, because the alternative was training NO ONE and burying everyone.",
    "confess.3": "Reed: Say what you came to say. I'll hold still.",
    "confess.choice": "What do you say to her?",
    "confess.opt.anger": "You knew. You KNEW.",
    "confess.opt.mercy": "You were carrying it alone.",
    "confess.opt.silence": "(Say nothing.)",
    "confess.r.anger": "Reed: Yes. Keep that. You'll need something that burns where you're going.",
    "confess.r.mercy": "Reed: …Don't forgive me yet. Wait until you've seen the bottom. Then decide.",
    "confess.r.silence": "Reed: …The kettle's bad here too. Sit a minute anyway.",
    "dacapo.1": "You sit. The chord passes to you like a weight the world had been holding its breath under. Aria falls out of it, twelve years lighter, and weeps.",
    "dacapo.2": "Somewhere above, the music steadies. Da capo: from the beginning. The Roster gains a row.",
    "door.1": "A maintenance door, ajar. Below: a pillar the size of a belltower, humming a note you feel in your teeth.",
    "door.2": "A Conservatory work log hangs on a nail. Tightened the fourth stay. Resonance nominal. Next service: badge season.",
    "door.3": "The Halls are infrastructure. The thought arrives quietly and does not leave.",
    "echo4.ask": "Voltaccia's anchor hums under the substation. Hear it through the load?",
    "echo4.done": "The load holds. Barely.",
    "echo4.grant": "The grid's echo, conducted and kept. Four down.",
    "echo4.locked": "Four clefs before the grid's echo. House rules.",
    "echo4.story": "Every brownout for forty years logs the same missing frequency. The grid covers for the pillar. The bill goes to nobody.",
    "echo5.ask": "The opera sank a half-step the year of the Caesura. Nobody retuned it. Hear why?",
    "echo5.done": "Still sinking. Still singing.",
    "echo5.grant": "The fen's echo. Mind who you tell.",
    "echo5.locked": "Five clefs for the fen's echo. The mist insists.",
    "echo5.story": "The fen's anchor drinks the slack. Maren plays to it, alone, after closing. She thinks nobody knows. Everybody knows.",
    "echo6.ask": "The cairn on Gravoross's back - builders unknown? The keepers know.",
    "echo6.done": "The cairn stands.",
    "echo6.grant": "The pass's echo. Heavy, like everything here.",
    "echo6.locked": "Six clefs before the pass speaks.",
    "echo6.story": "It marks where the pass's anchor cracked, three centuries back. The mountain leans on the song more than most. The song leans back.",
    "echo7.ask": "The unfinished cadence - Glacialto's phrase. Want the keepers' half?",
    "echo7.done": "Still waiting. Aren't we all.",
    "echo7.grant": "The glacier's echo. Cold in the hand, isn't it.",
    "echo7.locked": "Seven clefs. The glacier doesn't negotiate.",
    "echo7.story": "It isn't unfinished. The last bar is scored for a voice that Faded in 1861. The glacier is waiting for a replacement that never comes.",
    "echo8.ask": "Beneath the Bass Hall: the first anchor. The one the others copy. Listen once and you'll never unhear it.",
    "echo8.done": "One instrument. Eight hands. Yours makes nine.",
    "echo8.grant": "The eighth echo. The set is complete; the question is yours now.",
    "echo8.locked": "All eight clefs, or the capital keeps its echo.",
    "echo8.story": "It doesn't hum the root. It hums a CHORD - eight notes, one per pillar, one per Hall. The whole circuit is one instrument. You've been walking a score.",
    "fen.talk": "Rush: Maren plays the empty house after closing. Respect for the building, I reckon.",
    "fen.talk.recontext": "Rush: She's not playing TO the house, is she. She's playing to what's under it. …Always knew. Didn't want to.",
    "finale.choice2": "Who holds the note?",
    "finale.choice3": "Who holds the note?",
    "finale.opt.chorus": "Everyone. (Raise the Chorus.)",
    "finale.opt.dacapo": "I do. (Take the seat.)",
    "finale.opt.tacet": "No one. (Hand Vesper the knife.)",
    "frost.talk": "Neve: The conservatoire archive lists every champion. Lovely penmanship. Retirements abroad, all of them.",
    "frost.talk.recontext": "Neve: I checked the shipping ledgers. No champion ever boarded a boat. Lovely penmanship, though.",
    "hall4.coiler.after": "She changes the weather mid-fight. You didn't hear it from me.",
    "hall4.coiler.defeat": "Grounded!",
    "hall4.coiler.intro": "Rhea likes challengers pre-shocked. Obliging her.",
    "hall4.rhea.after": "Rhea: The fen road eats boots. Buy spares.",
    "hall4.rhea.badge": "Rhea: The Mezzo-soprano clef - half of eight. The grid salutes you.",
    "hall4.rhea.defeat": "Rhea: Full output and you didn't brown out. HA!",
    "hall4.rhea.gift": "Rhea: And the Ferry Song rights. The water between here and Hollowfen is honest; the ground isn't.",
    "hall4.rhea.intro": "Rhea: Industry is rhythm with consequences. Let's hear yours under load!",
    "hall4.winder.after": "Mind the conveyors ahead.",
    "hall4.winder.defeat": "Unwound!",
    "hall4.winder.intro": "Coils wound. Tempo set. Begin!",
    "hall5.maren.after": "Maren: Deliver it or don't. But don't open it. It isn't addressed to you. (It is.)",
    "hall5.maren.badge": "Maren: The Alto clef. Five down. The air gets thin from here - and not with altitude.",
    "hall5.maren.defeat": "Maren: …Yes. You'll do.",
    "hall5.maren.intro": "Maren: An opera house remembers every voice it lost. Add yours gently.",
    "hall5.maren.letter1": "Maren: A favor, champion-shaped stranger. A letter - sealed - for whoever beats the Quartet.",
    "hall5.maren.letter2": "Maren: If that's you, well. Then it was always going to be you.",
    "hall5.prompter.after": "Maren hears everything in here. Everything.",
    "hall5.prompter.defeat": "Line lost…",
    "hall5.prompter.intro": "I feed lines to ghosts. You I'll feed to the mist.",
    "hall5.usher.after": "House left, then straight on.",
    "hall5.usher.defeat": "Curtain…",
    "hall5.usher.intro": "Seats, please. The Old Opera dislikes standing room.",
    "hall6.mason.after": "Chisel's yours. Go on up.",
    "hall6.mason.defeat": "Cracked!",
    "hall6.mason.intro": "Orsk tests patience. I test everything else.",
    "hall6.orsk.after": "Orsk: Frostine's up the pass. Dress warm. Ilva won't warm to you either way.",
    "hall6.orsk.badge": "Orsk: The Tenor clef. Six. The mountain counted with me.",
    "hall6.orsk.defeat": "Orsk: Hm. Faster than eventually.",
    "hall6.orsk.gift": "Orsk: Sky rights, too - the Skybridge Aria. The peaks stop being walls. Most walls stop, honestly.",
    "hall6.orsk.intro": "Orsk: The quarry teaches one lesson: everything yields. Eventually. Show me your 'eventually'.",
    "hall7.carver.after": "She doesn't WANT you to pass. Remember that, after.",
    "hall7.carver.defeat": "Chipped!",
    "hall7.carver.intro": "I carve the hall's hazards by hand. Want a tour?",
    "hall7.ilva.after": "Ilva: I tried. Witness that I tried.",
    "hall7.ilva.badge": "Ilva: The Baritone clef. Seven. I would take it back if I could.",
    "hall7.ilva.defeat": "Ilva: …So you insist on the truth's consequences.",
    "hall7.ilva.intro": "Ilva: Turn around. I'll say it once, plainly, as a kindness.",
    "hall7.ilva.intro2": "Ilva: No? Then I will be the wall. Forgive me for hoping you'd lose.",
    "hall7.ilva.mercy": "Ilva: The one merciful thing I could do was make you lose. You wouldn't let me.",
    "hall7.skater.after": "Ilva's hall is colder than the glacier. Not the air - her.",
    "hall7.skater.defeat": "Iced!",
    "hall7.skater.intro": "Edges sharp, tempo sharper. Race you to the barn!",
    "hall8.calder.after": "Calder: The Spire is open. The arithmetic is waiting.",
    "hall8.calder.badge": "Calder: The Bass clef. All eight. I will not congratulate you; you'll understand shortly.",
    "hall8.calder.defeat": "Calder: There it is. The resonance of a generation.",
    "hall8.calder.equation": "Calder: She gambles everyone to save one. I spend one to save everyone.",
    "hall8.calder.equation2": "Calder: Tell me which of us is the villain, and I will tell you that you haven't done the arithmetic yet.",
    "hall8.calder.intro": "Calder: I take the eighth myself, to look every finalist in the eye. Look back, if you can.",
    "hall8.registrar.after": "Filed under 'admitted'. He's waiting.",
    "hall8.registrar.defeat": "Stamped and sealed!",
    "hall8.registrar.intro": "The Provost sees finalists only. I file the rest.",
